WEBVTT

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.550
It's finally time to start school...

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.150
The first day is so exciting, isn't it?

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:15.260
Exciting, huh?

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.920
You seem more nervous 
than excited, Hina-chan.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:23.000
Yeah. I wonder if I'll make friends,

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.280
and if I'll be able to get along 
with my classmates...

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.700
Thinking about it all makes me so nervous.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.800
You're right. That is nerve-wracking.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:37.570
You're going to be standing on the stage 
with the theater troupe soon.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.930
Think of this as another type of training.

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.770
You're right.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:46.360
For starters, if I can get over freezing up 
whenever I'm in front of people...

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:47.810
You'll be fine!

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.180
Just look! You're talking to us 
right now, aren't you?

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.910
Yeah... I am!

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:59.930
I'm starting to feel like I can do this!

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:08.770
S-S-S-Sa... Saku...

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:13.210
S-Sakuragi... H-H-Hinako...

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:15.010
I-I'm from the... c-country...

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.940
<i>You can do it, Hina-chan!</i>

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:18.010
I'm Hinako!

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:53.020
<b>Mistaken Friend</b>

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.480
<b>Fujimiya
 Girls'
High</b>

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:57.110
I couldn't do it.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:01.280
N-No, that was a very unique 
self-introduction.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.180
Unique?

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.620
Hinako-chan.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.440
I can call you that, right?

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.120
So you lived in the country?

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:12.660
U-Um... I... uh...

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.910
Th-The... c-country...

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:17.140
Um...

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:18.340
That's right!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.510
I lived in the mountains 
and worked as a scarecrow!

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:26.680
Ventriloquism?

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.390
That's a funny way to communicate!

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:30.140
They laughed.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.810
So what did you do as a scarecrow?

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.770
Oh, yeah! I'm curious, too!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.740
Well, you see...

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:41.530
Chiaki-chan!

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:43.910
Look at this.

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:45.910
<b>Theater Society</b>

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:45.910
<b>Recruiting Members</b>

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.260
What's this about?

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:52.800
Well, you see, all the fans of Chiaki-chan, 
the theater club ace,

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:55.020
put this together over spring break!

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:58.410
You know, since the club went on hiatus,

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:01.580
we don't get to see you on stage, right?

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:02.340
Right...

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.540
That makes your fans really sad.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:09.850
And you seemed really disappointed 
when it went on hiatus, too.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:14.350
So we thought, if we started 
a theater society, you could act again!

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.610
Huh? Chiaki-chan?

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:23.170
That ventriloquism talk 
went over better than I thought.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:27.240
Yeah. I wasn't able to say a word, though.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.240
Hina-chan! Kuu-chan!

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:31.830
Miss Landlady!

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:35.050
What's up?

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:38.740
Well, there's something I wanted to show you.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:39.750
Here.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:45.210
Theater society... recruiting members?

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:51.230
Miss Landlady, what's this about a society?

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:57.030
My friends put it together to replace 
the theater club while it's on hiatus.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:00.940
So that means we'll be able 
to do theater here at this school?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.520
That's right.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:06.180
So about that...

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.410
What do you two want to do?

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:11.280
Of course, I'll join!

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.180
I'm with Hina-chan!

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:20.870
Okay, could you come to the 
theater club room later?

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:24.160
It's just a society now, 
but you'll still need to apply.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.640
Got it!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.010
This is great, Hina-chan!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:29.820
Yeah!

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:31.810
Hey, you there!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:34.650
Are you friends with Chiaki-senpai?

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:35.160
Huh?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.060
You were talking to her like you are!

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.310
Why? What's going on between you?

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.010
Eh... ah... i-it...

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:43.890
Um, I'm sorry, but who might you be?

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:46.040
I just introduced myself earlier!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.330
I'm your classmate, Nakajima Yua!

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:52.740
I want to be an actress, and I enrolled in 
this school because of Chiaki-senpai's acting!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.380
Oh, really?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.580
Yes, really!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.330
So...

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:01.590
How can a little shrimp like you 
be friends with Chiaki-senpai?

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:07.080
S-Sorry! I might have gone too far!

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.310
I guess she's a nice person deep down...

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.470
But I still want to know what the deal is!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.650
Argh!

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.720
I don't get her at all.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.850
Um, Nakajima-san?

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:17.980
What?!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.980
Hina-chan and I have 
somewhere we need to go,

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.620
so we'll be going now.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:25.230
Huh? Hey!

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.240
<b>Theater Club</b>

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.990
Oh, you're both here. Welcome.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.910
M-Miss Landlady!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.090
What happened?

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.220
We ran into someone pretty powerful.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.880
I see. There, there.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.310
I need to talk to you!

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.770
Well? Are you really 
planning to join the club?

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:04.150
Eh... um... Y-Yes...

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.130
I'll never approve of you joining!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.460
Wh-Why not?

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:10.530
Why not?!

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.440
A failure of a little shrimp like you...

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:15.620
Jeez, that's hard to say.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:21.230
Yes! A failshrimp like you isn't fit to be 
in this theater club with Chiaki-senpai!

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.230
U-Um...

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:23.920
In fact, you're not fit for Chiaki-senpai!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:27.980
Do you even have the guts 
to stand on a stage?

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:27.980
Um...

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.440
Are we interrupting something?

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.670
U-Uh...

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:35.230
Um, um... well... I mean...

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:36.680
No. Nothing.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.720
I see. So, um, are you 
hoping to join the club?

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:41.980
Y-Yes!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.170
What's your name?

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.940
Nakajima Yua.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.070
Yua-chan? That's a nice name.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.440
Let's do our best together.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.610
Th-Th...

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.700
Thank you for having me!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.450
Well, I'll be going now!

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:03.780
Huh? Did I do something to her?

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:06.640
At any rate, you saved Hina-chan.

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.210
Huh?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:23.300
You make such delicious tea, Mayu-chan.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.230
Thanks.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:28.880
By the way, I heard you two 
joined the theater club?

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:29.720
Yeah!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.440
It's just a society now, though.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.240
But it's the theater club 
at its core, right?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:38.990
Yeah. All the club members are joining, too.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:45.870
In any case, Hina-chan's goal of being 
in theater at Fujimiya High has come true.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.370
Yeah!

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:51.600
Wait... But we've only just 
formed our theater troupe.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:55.380
Was it okay for us to join the theater club?

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.390
Why don't you just do both?

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.590
We can do both?

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:02.620
Sounds like you'll be busy.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:03.520
That's true.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:08.570
There's another hurdle Hina-chan 
needs to get over first, after all.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.440
Hurdle?

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:14.170
I mean getting used to 
being in front of people!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.320
I-In front of people...

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:21.120
Then how about working part-time 
in the coffee shop?

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.960
That sounds good. It's a 
service industry, after all.

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.210
Okay, it's settled!

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:29.490
Hina-chan, try working here 
on your next day off from school.

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:31.340
Ah... u-um...

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:34.090
Don't worry! Leave everything to me!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:37.300
U-Um...

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:38.590
Okay.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:47.980
I let Mayu-chan talk me 
into agreeing, but...

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:49.980
Let's see...

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:54.990
Theater troupe, theater club, 
serving customers part-time...

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.990
How am I gonna do this?!

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:05.500
But as long as I don't get nervous, 
things seem to work out okay...

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:11.000
I guess all I can do is try my best.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.890
<b>Fujimiya
 Girls'
 High</b>

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:22.870
"I may be mistaken, 
but that's what I think.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:28.780
At any rate, the bear's gall of 
Nametoko Mountain is well-known."

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:31.400
Okay, the next passage...

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.730
Sakuragi-san.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.020
Y-Yes!

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:43.530
"I-It cures s-stomachaches 
and m-makes wounds disappear.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:47.100
A-At the N-N-Namari-no-Yu entrance..."

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.540
Sensei!

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.540
I'll read it for her.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.410
Uh...

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:56.350
O-Okay, go ahead, then.

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:58.400
Sakuragi-san, you can sit down.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.050
O-Okay...

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:03.460
"It cures stomachaches and 
makes wounds disappear.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:05.300
At the Namari-no-Yu entrance,

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:10.310
a sign has long stood that 
reads, 'Bear's gall here.'"

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:10.310
<i>Isn't she... that scary girl?</i>

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:15.700
Oh, darn...

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.120
Uh... Sakuragi-san.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.370
Y-Yes?

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:24.070
Can you help me carry 
the handouts on the desk here?

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:28.000
U-U-U-Uh...

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.330
I'll carry them!

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:33.320
Hmph!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:44.770
Okay... Sakuragi-san.

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:46.610
Y-Yes! Um...

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:48.210
I'll answer it!

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:49.980
Sakuragi-san.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.230
Y-Yes!

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.730
Let me handle it!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.980
Sakuragi-san.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:54.700
Y-Ye—

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.110
I'll go!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.100
Sakuragi-san.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:58.850
I'll answer it!

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:00.350
Sakuragi-san.

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:01.670
I'll take it!

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.230
Sakuragi-san.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:04.420
I'll do it for her!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:05.440
Sakuragi-san.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:06.660
Let me handle it!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.370
Sakuragi-san.

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.060
I'll do that!

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:08.740
Sakuragi-san.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:09.530
I'll carry it!

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:10.150
Sakuragi-san.

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:11.700
I'll do it for her!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:12.620
I'll do that!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.330
Hina-chan!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.380
Y-Yes?

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.800
Let's head home.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:19.880
Okay.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.720
What should we eat on the way home today?

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.580
We're having dinner as soon as we get home.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:27.510
Eating books to hold myself over is kinda...

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.000
The desserts there are the best!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.020
Really?

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.620
Hmm... Oh!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.660
Wait here a second, okay?

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:41.200
Excuse me! I'd like one of these 
and one of these.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:42.780
Um...

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:47.390
Excuse me, but which way is the station?

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:51.250
U-Um... I... uh...

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.980
I'll show you the way!

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:56.180
Please, come with me.

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:58.290
Thank you so much.

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:01.050
You need to get to the station, right?

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.820
Just turn left at that traffic signal there,

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:06.450
then go straight, 
and you'll see it right away.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:10.510
Oh, thank you. 
You've been such a big help.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:18.350
<i>This'll show everyone that I can do 
what that little failure can't!</i>

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:22.470
<i>How was that? Do you see 
what a failshrimp you are now?</i>

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:26.570
<i>The one fit for Chiaki-senpai 
is me, Nakajima Yu—</i>

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:32.400
<i>Did I take that too far?</i>

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.080
<i>No!</i>

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:38.580
<i>Don't think that way, Yua! 
You must harden your heart!</i>

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.300
<i>Look nowhere but forward!</i>

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:44.110
<i>She's so nice...</i>

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:47.920
<i>She always covers for me when I fall short.</i>

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:50.190
<i>Maybe we can be friends...</i>

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.680
Here you go.

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:00.480
Oh... uh...

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:05.690
Actually putting on that uniform 
might be kind of embarrassing...

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.360
You need guts, too!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.740
Guts?

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:13.240
Could I work at the used bookstore, maybe?

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.680
The bookstore is closed today.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:20.880
Oh... So that's why she's been 
nodding off all morning.

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:23.380
Strawberry parfait...

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:30.150
Don't worry! I'll support you 
all the way! Okay?

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.140
O-Okay...

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:37.770
Th-Then... I'll be counting on you.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.770
Trust me!

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:45.080
Good luck. With everything.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:51.950
Hina-chan, you look so cute!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.890
R-Really?

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:56.380
It looks great on you! It does!

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:57.790
Okay, next is this!

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:00.040
N-Next?

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:05.050
This looks great, too!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:09.960
M-Mayu-chan, is this really a uniform?

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.600
It is, meow!

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:12.550
Meow?

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.050
You try it, too.

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:15.560
Meow, meow!

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:18.430
M-Meow, meow?

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:21.190
Squee! You're too cute!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.780
Hina-chan, let's move 
right on to the next one!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.780
I can't eat any more...

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.190
Huh?!

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:28.070
Changing outfits on a doll...

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:33.950
Oops, I dozed off.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:40.210
Oh, Kuu-chan! You're awake now?

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:44.460
I think I'm still dreaming.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:52.710
I guess clean and pure really is best.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.600
Well, ready to get started now?

00:15:57.080 --> 00:16:01.330
I've never done any work 
other than being a scarecrow...

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:05.410
Oh, Mayu-chan, do you have any tips 
for serving customers?

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:06.340
Eh?

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.480
Hmm... well...

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:13.380
There's greeting them properly, 
speaking loudly,

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:16.370
and everything else 
can be solved with a smile.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.590
<i>She's so cute!</i>

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:23.850
We hardly get any customers, anyway...

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:24.750
Huh?

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.540
I know Mayu-chan said that,

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:34.260
but what if we do get customers?

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:39.990
Just thinking about serving customers 
makes me nervous...

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:45.520
You're right! I can't lose my confidence!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:51.650
Thanks. Sorry I worried you. I'm okay now.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:57.910
U-Um...

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:01.810
You can talk to birds?

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:04.070
Can that bird talk?

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.170
N-No... um...

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.660
<i>She's got her hopes up...</i>

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:19.190
Hi there! I'm Toritarou, tweet!

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:22.930
What brings you here by yourself? 
Are you on a walk?

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:27.310
No. I got lost and can't find my way home.

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.700
What? That's awful!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:31.650
Oh!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.760
Th-That's awful! Um... um...

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:36.910
Do you know your home phone number?

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:37.820
Uh huh.

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:41.460
Then call your family with this.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.700
I'm sure they'll come for you, tweet.

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.460
<i>I feel a little guilty somehow...</i>

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.340
Oh, hello? Mommy? I'm at... um...

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.160
Coffee Shop Hitotose.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:04.540
I'm at a place called 
"Coffee Shop Hitotose."

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:08.470
Uh huh. I'm with a girl 
in a really fancy costume!

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.280
Oh, welco—

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:13.980
Huh?

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:16.480
Um, she seems to be lost.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.110
Oh, dear!

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:21.600
Oh, but we've already called her mom,

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.100
and she's coming for her.

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:26.370
Really? That's good, then.

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:29.410
Make yourself at home, okay?

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:30.280
Okay!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.540
Hina-chan, you did great!

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:38.140
You were able to talk to her, right?

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:40.470
Oh, I didn't do anything.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.640
It was all Toritarou.

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:46.430
Toritarou? Who is that?

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:50.890
Thanks, Toritarou and the lady!

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:51.820
See you later!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.370
Really, thank you so much.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:55.650
Y-Y-Y-Y...

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.030
You're wellfrm!

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:01.860
We'll be going, then.

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:03.040
Bye!

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:08.790
There, there.

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:15.230
What a tiring day.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:19.550
I wasn't able to talk to a single 
customer the whole time.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:25.970
I'll completely fail both the theater troupe 
and the theater club at this rate.

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:29.560
I really am a failshrimp.

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:38.340
I know! I'll try my hardest 
to talk to that girl!

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:41.660
I can't move forward 
if I keep talking about failing.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:44.490
I have to do my best at what I can do!

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:49.000
Okay! Time to take a step forward!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.500
<b>Fujimiya 
Girls' 
High</b>

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:54.020
Good morning!

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:01.110
Okay, you go on ahead.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:02.380
Okay.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.680
Oh, Nakajima-san?

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.390
Wh-Where'd you come from?!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:13.440
U-Um... uh...

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.150
So you're actually here!

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:20.090
I thought you'd be bawling after learning 
that I'm the one fit for Chiaki-senpai,

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:22.780
and maybe you wouldn't 
come to school anymore.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:27.580
Actually, I was wondering 
what I'd do if you didn't come.

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:32.050
You've got some guts!

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:36.300
Huh? The landlady? Um, what do you mean?

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:40.080
What do I mean?! You realize 
that you're a failshrimp, right?

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.240
After all those times I covered for you!

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.550
Oh, yeah!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:45.970
Thanks for helping me out so much.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.730
It made me really happy.

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:48.540
Huh?

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:53.430
So, there's actually something 
I've been wanting to say to you...

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:55.420
Wh-What?

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:58.690
I'd like to be...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:04.200
...f-f-f-friends with you, if you don't mind!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.700
F-Friends?

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:11.120
A-Are you sure you're not mistaken?

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:11.640
Huh?

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:14.500
I wasn't trying to help you or...

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:17.080
Oh, Sakuragi-san, could you...

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:19.560
I'll take them!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:20.380
Uh...

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:22.930
You helped me again!

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:27.790
I-I did not! That was a 
conditioned reflex, or something...

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:29.600
Thanks!

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:37.160
I think we'll be really good friends!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.800
Hmph. Let's just get going.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:43.210
Hey, Nakajima-san...

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:48.570
Can I call you Yua-chan from now on?

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.290
Do what you want.

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:52.420
Thanks, Yua-chan!

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:53.260
Hmph!

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:35.470
<b>The Scarecrow Heroine</b>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:30.280
I'm so glad Hina-chan 
seems to have made a friend!

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:33.030
And the theater society's 
activities have begun, too.

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:36.640
It sounds like Hina-chan is practicing 
lots of things every day.

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.820
Next time: "The Scarecrow Heroine."
